      "notes": "Pinned to the 0.5.x series (R 4.5): with webR 0.6.0 and the R 4.6 repository, compiled packages such as RSQLite, jsonlite, nanoparquet and fastmap fail to load (dynamic linking TypeError), verified against the official CDN on 2026-11-02. The R runtime (R.wasm, libRblas.so, libRlapack.so and the virtual filesystem) is GNU R, licensed GPL-2 | GPL-3. Source: https://github.com/r-wasm/webr and https://cran.r-project.org/sources.html",
      "files": [
        { "path": "dist/webr.js", "as": "webr.mjs", "wrap": "text" },
